&quot;fell-back&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-guerrilla-warriors" data-term-title="GUERRILLA WARRIORS" data-term-summary="Your Movement phase, just after a KROOT unit from your army Falls Back. That KROOT unit. Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kroot-hunting-pack.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack">GUERRILLA WARRIORS</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Movement phase, just after a KROOT unit from your army Falls Back.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>That KROOT unit.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-hidden-hunters" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;KROOT&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;targeted-by-enemy-attack&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-hidden-hunters" data-term-title="HIDDEN HUNTERS" data-term-summary="Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets. One KROOT unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks. Until the end of the phase, your unit can only be selected as the target of a ranged attack if the attacking model is within 18&quot;." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kroot-hunting-pack.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack">HIDDEN HUNTERS</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One KROOT unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, your unit can only be selected as the target of a ranged attack if the attacking model is within 18&quot;.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-join-the-hunt" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;alternatives&quot;:[{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;KROOT&quot;,&quot;INFANTRY&quot;]},{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-kroot-hounds&quot;]}]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;unit-destroyed&quot;,&quot;once-per-battle&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-join-the-hunt" data-term-title="JOIN THE HUNT" data-term-summary="Any phase. One KROOT INFANTRY or KROOT HOUNDS unit from your army that was just destroyed. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed. Add a new unit to your army identical to your destroyed unit, in Strategic Reserves, at its Starting Strength. This Stratagem cannot be used to return destroyed CHARACTER units to Attached units. You can only use this Stratagem once per battle." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kroot-hunting-pack.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack">JOIN THE HUNT</button></h3></div><div class="cp">2CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Any phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One KROOT INFANTRY or KROOT HOUNDS unit from your army that was just destroyed. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Add a new unit to your army identical to your destroyed unit, in Strategic Reserves, at its Starting Strength.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="restrictions"><b>Restrictions</b><br>This Stratagem cannot be used to return destroyed CHARACTER units to Attached units. You can only use this Stratagem once per battle.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-the-grisly-feast" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;KROOT&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;destroyed-enemy-this-phase&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-the-grisly-feast" data-term-title="THE GRISLY FEAST" data-term-summary="Fight phase. One KROOT unit from your army that destroyed one or more enemy units this phase. In your opponent’s next Command phase, each enemy unit within 6&quot; of your unit must take a Battle-shock test. If the unit taking that test is Below Half-strength, subtract 1 from that test. Enemy units affected by this Stratagem do not need to take any other Battle-shock tests in the same phase." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kroot-hunting-pack.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack">THE GRISLY FEAST</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Fight phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One KROOT unit from your army that destroyed one or more enemy units this phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>In your opponent’s next Command phase, each enemy unit within 6&quot; of your unit must take a Battle-shock test. If the unit taking that test is Below Half-strength, subtract 1 from that test. Enemy units affected by this Stratagem do not need to take any other Battle-shock tests in the same phase.</p></article></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-borthrod-gland" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-kroot-flesh-shaper&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 15 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-enhancement-borthrod-gland" data-term-title="Borthrod Gland" data-term-summary="Kroot Flesh Shaper only. While the bearer is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, an unmodified Hit roll of 5+ scores a Critical Hit." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kroot-hunting-pack.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack">Borthrod Gland</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">Kroot Flesh Shaper only. While the bearer is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, an unmodified Hit roll of 5+ scores a Critical Hit.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-kroothawk-flock" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-kroot-flesh-shaper&quot;,&quot;unit-kroot-lone-spear&quot;,&quot;unit-kroot-trail-shaper&quot;,&quot;unit-kroot-war-shaper&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 10 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-enhancement-kroothawk-flock" data-term-title="Kroothawk Flock" data-term-summary="KROOT model only. Ranged weapons equipped by models in the bearer’s unit have the [IGNORES COVER] ability, and enemy units that are set up on the battlefield as Reinforcements cannot be set up within 12&quot; horizontally of the bearer." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kroot-hunting-pack.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack">Kroothawk Flock</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">KROOT model only. Ranged weapons equipped by models in the bearer’s unit have the [IGNORES COVER] ability, and enemy units that are set up on the battlefield as Reinforcements cannot be set up within 12&quot; horizontally of the bearer.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-nomadic-hunter" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-kroot-trail-shaper&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 20 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-enhancement-nomadic-hunter" data-term-title="Nomadic Hunter" data-term-summary="KROOT TRAIL SHAPER model only. While the bearer is leading a unit, add 3&quot; to the Move characteristic of models in that unit and ranged weapons equipped by models in that unit have the [ASSAULT] ability." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kroot-hunting-pack.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack">Nomadic Hunter</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">KROOT TRAIL SHAPER model only. While the bearer is leading a unit, add 3&quot; to the Move characteristic of models in that unit and ranged weapons equipped by models in that unit have the [ASSAULT] ability.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-root-carved-weapons" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-kroot-war-shaper&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 10 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-enhancement-root-carved-weapons" data-term-title="Root-carved Weapons" data-term-summary="Kroot War Shaper model only. All weapons equipped by the bearer have the [PRECISION] and [DEVASTATING WOUNDS] abilities." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kroot-hunting-pack.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack">Root-carved Weapons</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">Kroot War Shaper model only. All weapons equipped by the bearer have the [PRECISION] and [DEVASTATING WOUNDS] abilities.</p></article></div></section><section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="montka" data-keyword-grants="[]"><h2>MONT'KA <span class="detachment-dp">3DP</span></h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-aggressive-mobility" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;T'AU EMPIRE&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;not-selected-to-move&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-aggressive-mobility" data-term-title="AGGRESSIVE MOBILITY" data-term-summary="Your Movement phase. One T’AU EMPIRE unit from your army that has not been selected to move this phase. Until the end of the phase, if your unit Advances, do not make an Advance roll for it. Instead, until the end of the phase, add 6&quot; to the Move characteristic of models in your unit." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-montka" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/montka.html#detachment-montka">AGGRESSIVE MOBILITY</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Movement phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One T’AU EMPIRE unit from your army that has not been selected to move this phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, if your unit Advances, do not make an Advance roll for it. Instead, until the end of the phase, add 6&quot; to the Move characteristic of models in your unit.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-combat-debarkation" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;T'AU EMPIRE&quot;,&quot;INFANTRY&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;disembarked-this-turn&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-combat-debarkation" data-term-title="COMBAT DEBARKATION" data-term-summary="Your Shooting phase. One T’AU EMPIRE INFANTRY unit from your army that disembarked from a TRANSPORT this turn. Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets the closest enemy unit, you can re-roll the Wound roll." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-montka" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/montka.html#detachment-montka">COMBAT DEBARKATION</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One T’AU EMPIRE INFANTRY unit from your army that disembarked from a TRANSPORT this turn.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets the closest enemy unit, you can re-roll the Wound roll.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-counterfire-defence-systems" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;T'AU EMPIRE&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;targeted-by-enemy-attack&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-counterfire-defence-systems" data-term-title="COUNTERFIRE DEFENCE SYSTEMS" data-term-summary="Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets. One T’AU EMPIRE unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks. Until the end of the phase, each time an attack is allocated to your unit, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-montka" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/montka.html#detachment-montka">COUNTERFIRE DEFENCE SYSTEMS</button></h3></div><div class="cp">2CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One T’AU EMPIRE unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, each time an attack is allocated to your unit, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-focused-fire" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-targets&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:2,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;T'AU EMPIRE&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;not-selected-to-shoot&quot;,&quot;battle-round-1-to-3&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-focused-fire" data-term-title="FOCUSED FIRE" data-term-summary="Start of your Shooting phase. Two T’AU EMPIRE units from your army that have not been selected to shoot this phase, and one enemy unit. Until the end of the phase, each time a model in either of your units makes an attack, it can only target that enemy unit (and only if it is an eligible target for that attack), and when resolving that attack, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic by 1. You cannot use this Stratagem during the fourth or fifth battle rounds." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-montka" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/montka.html#detachment-montka">FOCUSED FIRE</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Start of your Shooting phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>Two T’AU EMPIRE units from your army that have not been selected to shoot this phase, and one enemy unit.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, each time a model in either of your units makes an attack, it can only target that enemy unit (and only if it is an eligible target for that attack), and when resolving that attack, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic by 1.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="restrictions"><b>Restrictions</b><br>You cannot use this Stratagem during the fourth or fifth battle rounds.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-pinpoint-counter-offensive" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;T'AU EMPIRE&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;KROOT&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;unit-destroyed&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-pinpoint-counter-offensive" data-term-title="PINPOINT COUNTER-OFFENSIVE" data-term-summary="Any phase. One T’AU EMPIRE unit (excluding KROOT units) from your army that was just destroyed. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed. Until the end of the battle, each time a T’AU EMPIRE unit (excluding KROOT units) from your army makes an attack that targets the enemy unit that just destroyed your unit, you can re-roll the Hit roll." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-montka" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/montka.html#detachment-montka">PINPOINT COUNTER-OFFENSIVE</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Any phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One T’AU EMPIRE unit (excluding KROOT units) from your army that was just destroyed. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the battle, each time a T’AU EMPIRE unit (excluding KROOT units) from your army makes an attack that targets the enemy unit that just destroyed your unit, you can re-roll the Hit roll.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-pulse-onslaught" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;T'AU EMPIRE&quot;,&quot;INFANTRY&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;KROOT&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;unit-shot&quot;,&quot;enemy-hit&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-pulse-onslaught" data-term-title="PULSE ONSLAUGHT" data-term-summary="Your Shooting phase. One T’AU EMPIRE INFANTRY unit (excluding KROOT units) from your army that has just shot, and one enemy unit (excluding MONSTERS and VEHICLES) hit by one or more of those attacks. Until the end of your opponent’s next turn, that enemy unit is shaken. While a unit is shaken, subtract 2 from its Move characteristic and subtract 2 from Advance and Charge rolls made for it." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-montka" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/montka.html#detachment-montka">PULSE ONSLAUGHT</button></h3></div><div class="cp">2CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One T’AU EMPIRE INFANTRY unit (excluding KROOT units) from your army that has just shot, and one enemy unit (excluding MONSTERS and VEHICLES) hit by one or more of those attacks.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of your opponent’s next turn, that enemy unit is shaken. While a unit is shaken, subtract 2 from its Move characteristic and subtract 2 from Advance and Charge rolls made for it.</p></article></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-coordinated-exploitation" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-cadre-fireblade&quot;,&quot;unit-commander-in-coldstar-battlesuit&quot;,&quot;unit-commander-in-enforcer-battlesuit&quot;,&quot;unit-ethereal&quot;,&quot;unit-firesight-team&quot;,&quot;unit-kroot-lone-spear&quot;,&quot;unit-commander-in-crisis-battlesuit&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 30 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-enhancement-coordinated-exploitation" data-term-title="Coordinated Exploitation" data-term-summary="T’AU EMPIRE model only (excluding KROOT SHAPER models). While the bearer is leading a unit, each time that unit is an Observer unit, until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in a Guided unit have the [SUSTAINED HITS 1] ability while targeting their Spotted…" data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-montka" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/montka.html#detachment-montka">Coordinated Exploitation</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">T’AU EMPIRE model only (excluding KROOT SHAPER models). While the bearer is leading a unit, each time that unit is an Observer unit, until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in a Guided unit have the [SUSTAINED HITS 1] ability while targeting their Spotted unit.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-exemplar-of-the-montka" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-cadre-fireblade&quot;,&quot;unit-commander-in-coldstar-battlesuit&quot;,&quot;unit-commander-in-enforcer-battlesuit&quot;,&quot;unit-ethereal&quot;,&quot;unit-firesight-team&quot;,&quot;unit-kroot-lone-spear&quot;,&quot;unit-commander-in-crisis-battlesuit&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 10 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-enhancement-exemplar-of-the-montka" data-term-title="Exemplar of the Mont’ka" data-term-summary="T’AU EMPIRE model only (excluding KROOT SHAPER models). While the bearer is leading a unit, the Killing Blow Detachment rule applies to that unit during the fourth battle round as well." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-montka" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/montka.html#detachment-montka">Exemplar of the Mont’ka</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">T’AU EMPIRE model only (excluding KROOT SHAPER models). While the bearer is leading a unit, the Killing Blow Detachment rule applies to that unit during the fourth battle round as well.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-strategic-conqueror" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-cadre-fireblade&quot;,&quot;unit-commander-in-coldstar-battlesuit&quot;,&quot;unit-commander-in-enforcer-battlesuit&quot;,&quot;unit-ethereal&quot;,&quot;unit-firesight-team&quot;,&quot;unit-kroot-flesh-shaper&quot;,&quot;unit-kroot-lone-spear&quot;,&quot;unit-kroot-trail-shaper&quot;,&quot;unit-kroot-war-shaper&quot;,&quot;unit-commander-in-crisis-battlesuit&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 15 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-enhancement-strategic-conqueror" data-term-title="Strategic Conqueror" data-term-summary="T’AU EMPIRE model only. At the start of the first battle round, before the first turn begins, select one objective marker on the battlefield.…" data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-montka" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/montka.html#detachment-montka">Strategic Conqueror</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">T’AU EMPIRE model only. At the start of the first battle round, before the first turn begins, select one objective marker on the battlefield. While a friendly T’AU EMPIRE model is within range of that objective marker and the bearer is on the battlefield, add 1 to that friendly model’s Objective Control characteristic.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-strike-swiftly" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-cadre-fireblade&quot;,&quot;unit-commander-in-coldstar-battlesuit&quot;,&quot;unit-commander-in-enforcer-battlesuit&quot;,&quot;unit-ethereal&quot;,&quot;unit-firesight-team&quot;,&quot;unit-kroot-flesh-shaper&quot;,&quot;unit-kroot-lone-spear&quot;,&quot;unit-kroot-trail-shaper&quot;,&quot;unit-kroot-war-shaper&quot;,&quot;unit-commander-in-crisis-battlesuit&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 35 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-enhancement-strike-swiftly" data-term-title="Strike Swiftly" data-term-summary="In the Resolve Pre-battle Abilities step, you can select up to two friendly T’AU EMPIRE units within 6&quot; of this model that do not have the Scouts ability. Until the end of the battle, all models in the selected units have the Scouts 6&quot; ability." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-montka" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/montka.html#detachment-montka">Strike Swiftly</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">In the Resolve Pre-battle Abilities step, you can select up to two friendly T’AU EMPIRE units within 6&quot; of this model that do not have the Scouts ability. Until the end of the battle, all models in the selected units have the Scouts 6&quot; ability.</p></article></div></section><section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="retaliation-cadre" data-keyword-grants="[]"><h2>RETALIATION CADRE <span class="detachment-dp">3DP</span></h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-fail-safe-detonator" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;T'AU EMPIRE&quot;,&quot;BATTLESUIT&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;battlesuit-model-destroyed&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-fail-safe-detonator" data-term-title="FAIL-SAFE DETONATOR" data-term-summary="Any phase, just after a T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT model from your army is destroyed. That destroyed model’s unit. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even if that unit was just destroyed. Before removing your model from play, if it has the Deadly Demise ability, do not roll for that ability; instead, you can choose whether the result of that roll is a 1 or a 6. If your model does not have the Deadly Demise ability, roll one D6 for each unit within 6&quot; of it: on a 4+, that unit suffers D3 mortal wounds." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-retaliation-cadre" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/retaliation-cadre.html#detachment-retaliation-cadre">FAIL-SAFE DETONATOR</button></h3></div><div class="cp">2CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Any phase, just after a T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT model from your army is destroyed.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>That destroyed model’s unit. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even if that unit was just destroyed.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Before removing your model from play, if it has the Deadly Demise ability, do not roll for that ability; instead, you can choose whether the result of that roll is a 1 or a 6. If your model does not have the Deadly Demise ability, roll one D6 for each unit within 6&quot; of it: on a 4+, that unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-grav-inhibitor-field" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;T'AU EMPIRE&quot;,&quot;BATTLESUIT&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;charge-target&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-grav-inhibitor-field" data-term-title="GRAV-INHIBITOR FIELD" data-term-summary="Your opponent’s Charge phase, just after an enemy unit has declared a charge. One T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT unit from your army that was selected as a target of that charge. That enemy unit must immediately take a Battle-shock test and you must roll one D6 for each model in that enemy unit: for each 6, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-retaliation-cadre" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/retaliation-cadre.html#detachment-retaliation-cadre">GRAV-INHIBITOR FIELD</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent’s Charge phase, just after an enemy unit has declared a charge.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT unit from your army that was selected as a target of that charge.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>That enemy unit must immediately take a Battle-shock test and you must roll one D6 for each model in that enemy unit: for each 6, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-stimm-injectors" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;T'AU EMPIRE&quot;,&quot;BATTLESUIT&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;targeted-by-enemy-attack&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-stimm-injectors" data-term-title="STIMM INJECTORS" data-term-summary="Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets. One T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks. Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have the Feel No Pain 6+ ability." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-retaliation-cadre" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/retaliation-cadre.html#detachment-retaliation-cadre">STIMM INJECTORS</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have the Feel No Pain 6+ ability.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-the-arrokon-protocol" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;T'AU EMPIRE&quot;,&quot;BATTLESUIT&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;not-selected-to-shoot&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-the-arrokon-protocol" data-term-title="THE ARRO’KON PROTOCOL" data-term-summary="Your Shooting phase. One T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase. Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets an enemy unit that contains 6 or more models, that attack has the [SUSTAINED HITS 1] ability. If that attack targets an enemy unit that contains 11 or more models, it has the [SUSTAINED HITS 2] ability instead." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-retaliation-cadre" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/retaliation-cadre.html#detachment-retaliation-cadre">THE ARRO’KON PROTOCOL</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets an enemy unit that contains 6 or more models, that attack has the [SUSTAINED HITS 1] ability. If that attack targets an enemy unit that contains 11 or more models, it has the [SUSTAINED HITS 2] ability instead.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-the-shortened-blade" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;T'AU EMPIRE&quot;,&quot;BATTLESUIT&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;arriving-by-deep-strike&quot;,&quot;cannot-charge&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-the-shortened-blade" data-term-title="THE SHORTENED BLADE" data-term-summary="Your Movement phase. One T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT unit from your army that is arriving using the Deep Strike ability this phase. Your unit can be set up anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 6&quot; horizontally away from all enemy models. A unit targeted with this Stratagem is not eligible to declare a charge in the same turn." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-retaliation-cadre" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/retaliation-cadre.html#detachment-retaliation-cadre">THE SHORTENED BLADE</button></h3></div><div class="cp">2CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Movement phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT unit from your army that is arriving using the Deep Strike ability this phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Your unit can be set up anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 6&quot; horizontally away from all enemy models.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="restrictions"><b>Restrictions</b><br>A unit targeted with this Stratagem is not eligible to declare a charge in the same turn.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-the-torchstar-gambit" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;T'AU EMPIRE&quot;,&quot;BATTLESUIT&quot;,&quot;FLY&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;attacks-resolved&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-the-torchstar-gambit" data-term-title="THE TORCHSTAR GAMBIT" data-term-summary="Your Shooting phase. One T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT unit from your army that can FLY whose attacks have been resolved this phase. If your unit is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, it can make a Normal move. If it does, your unit cannot declare a charge this turn" data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-retaliation-cadre" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/retaliation-cadre.html#detachment-retaliation-cadre">THE TORCHSTAR GAMBIT</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT unit from your army that can FLY whose attacks have been resolved this phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>If your unit is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, it can make a Normal move. If it does, your unit cannot declare a charge this turn</p></article></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-internal-grenade-racks" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-commander-in-coldstar-battlesuit&quot;,&quot;unit-commander-in-enforcer-battlesuit&quot;,&quot;unit-commander-in-crisis-battlesuit&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 20 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-enhancement-internal-grenade-racks" data-term-title="Internal Grenade Racks" data-term-summary="T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT model only. The bearer has the GRENADES keyword, and each time the bearer ends a Normal move, you can select one enemy unit that it moved over during that move. If you do, roll six D6: for each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-retaliation-cadre" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/retaliation-cadre.html#detachment-retaliation-cadre">Internal Grenade Racks</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT model only. The bearer has the GRENADES keyword, and each time the bearer ends a Normal move, you can select one enemy unit that it moved over during that move. If you do, roll six D6: for each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-prototype-weapon-system" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-commander-in-coldstar-battlesuit&quot;,&quot;unit-commander-in-enforcer-battlesuit&quot;,&quot;unit-commander-in-crisis-battlesuit&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 15 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-enhancement-prototype-weapon-system" data-term-title="Prototype Weapon System" data-term-summary="T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT model only. Each time the bearer is selected to shoot, select either the [LETHAL HITS] or [SUSTAINED HITS 1] ability. Until those attacks are resolved, ranged weapons equipped by the bearer have the selected ability." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-retaliation-cadre" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/retaliation-cadre.html#detachment-retaliation-cadre">Prototype Weapon System</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT model only. Each time the bearer is selected to shoot, select either the [LETHAL HITS] or [SUSTAINED HITS 1] ability. Until those attacks are resolved, ranged weapons equipped by the bearer have the selected ability.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-puretide-engram-neurochip" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-commander-in-coldstar-battlesuit&quot;,&quot;unit-commander-in-enforcer-battlesuit&quot;,&quot;unit-commander-in-crisis-battlesuit&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 15 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-enhancement-puretide-engram-neurochip" data-term-title="Puretide Engram Neurochip" data-term-summary="T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT model only. Each time you target the bearer’s unit with a Stratagem, roll one D6: on a 4+, you gain 1CP." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-retaliation-cadre" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/retaliation-cadre.html#detachment-retaliation-cadre">Puretide Engram Neurochip</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT model only. Each time you target the bearer’s unit with a Stratagem, roll one D6: on a 4+, you gain 1CP.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-starflare-ignition-system" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-commander-in-coldstar-battlesuit&quot;,&quot;unit-commander-in-enforcer-battlesuit&quot;,&quot;unit-commander-in-crisis-battlesuit&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 20 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-enhancement-starflare-ignition-system" data-term-title="Starflare Ignition System" data-term-summary="T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT model only. At the end of your opponent’s turn, if the bearer’s unit is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, you can remove that unit from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-retaliation-cadre" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/retaliation-cadre.html#detachment-retaliation-cadre">Starflare Ignition System</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT model only. At the end of your opponent’s turn, if the bearer’s unit is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, you can remove that unit from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves.</p></article></div></section><section class="related-detachment related-core" data-detachment="core">
      <h2>Core Stratagems</h2>
      <div class="related-kind" data-related-kind="stratagems"><section class="content-group" id="core-stratagems" data-track="core-stratagems">
<h3 class="category-title">Core Stratagems</h3>
<p class="lead">Universal Stratagems available to every army. Datasheet tools only show the cards the selected unit can legally target.</p>
<div class="detachment-content stratagem-grid core-stratagem-grid">
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-command-re-roll" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;}]}">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>COMMAND RE-ROLL</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>Any phase, just after you make an Advance, Charge, Damage, Hazard, Hit, Save or Wound roll for a unit from your army, or a roll to determine the number of attacks made with a weapon equipped by a model in that unit.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>That unit or model from your army.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>Re-roll that roll. If several dice were rolled, select one of them to re-roll; Charge rolls are re-rolled in full.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-epic-challenge" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;]}]}">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>EPIC CHALLENGE</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>Fight phase, just after a friendly CHARACTER unit is selected to fight.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>That CHARACTER unit.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>Select one CHARACTER model in that unit. Until the end of the phase, its melee weapons have the PRECISION ability.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-insane-bravery" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;}]}">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="core-rule-15-04-insane-bravery" data-term-title="INSANE BRAVERY" data-term-summary="1CP Core Stratagem Indifferent to their own survival, these warriors hold their ground against seemingly impossible odds. WHEN: Battle-shock step of your Command phase, just before you make a battle-shock roll for a friendly unit. TARGET: That unit. EFFECT: That battle-shock roll is automatically successful. RESTRICTIONS: You cannot use this stratagem more than once per battle." data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/stratagems.html#rule-15-04">INSANE BRAVERY</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>Battle-shock step of your Command phase, just before a unit from your army takes a Battle-shock test.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>That unit.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>That test is automatically successful.</p>
<p class="field" data-source-field="restrictions"><b>RESTRICTIONS</b><br>Once per battle.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-explosives" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;any&quot;:[&quot;EXPLOSIVES&quot;,&quot;GRENADES&quot;]}]}">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>EXPLOSIVES</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>Your Shooting phase.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>One EXPLOSIVES or GRENADES unit from your army that is eligible to shoot, did not Advance this turn and is not within Engagement Range of enemy units.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>Select one eligible model, then one visible enemy unit within 8&quot; and outside Engagement Range. Roll six D6: for each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-crushing-impact" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;any&quot;:[&quot;MONSTER&quot;,&quot;VEHICLE&quot;]}]}">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>CRUSHING IMPACT</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>Your Charge phase, just after a MONSTER or VEHICLE unit from your army ends a Charge move.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>That MONSTER or VEHICLE unit.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>Select one enemy unit within Engagement Range and one model in your unit within Engagement Range of it. Roll a number of D6 equal to that model’s Toughness: each 1 inflicts 1 mortal wound on your unit; each 5+ inflicts 1 mortal wound on the enemy unit, to a maximum of 6.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-rapid-ingress" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;AIRCRAFT&quot;]}]}">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="core-rule-15-07-rapid-ingress" data-term-title="RAPID INGRESS" data-term-summary="1CP Core Stratagem Be it cunning strategy, potent technology or supernatural ritual, there are many means by which a commander may hasten their warriors’ onset. WHEN: End of your opponent’s Movement phase. TARGET: One friendly unit that is in strategic reserves (excluding AIRCRAFT). EFFECT: Your unit makes an ingress move. RESTRICTIONS: You cannot use this stratagem during the first battle round." data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/stratagems.html#rule-15-07">RAPID INGRESS</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>End of your opponent’s Movement phase.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>One unit from your army in Strategic Reserves, excluding AIRCRAFT.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>That unit can make an ingress move.</p>
<p class="field" data-source-field="restrictions"><b>RESTRICTIONS</b><br>Cannot be used during the first battle round.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-fire-overwatch" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;TITANIC&quot;]}]}">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>FIRE OVERWATCH</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>End of your opponent’s Movement phase.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>One unit from your army, excluding TITANIC units, that is not within Engagement Range of enemy units.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>Your unit can shoot one visible enemy unit within 24&quot; using Snap Shooting: only unmodified Hit rolls of 6 score a hit and Hit rolls cannot be re-rolled. After it has shot, that unit is not eligible to perform an Action this turn.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-smokescreen" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;SMOKE&quot;]}]}">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>SMOKESCREEN</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>Start of your opponent’s Shooting phase.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>One SMOKE unit from your army.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>Until the end of the phase, that unit has the Benefit of Cover. In addition, a friendly unit not fully visible to the attacking unit because it is obscured by the selected SMOKE unit also has the Benefit of Cover against that attack.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-heroic-intervention" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;VEHICLE&quot;]},{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;VEHICLE&quot;],&quot;any&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;,&quot;WALKER&quot;]}]}">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>HEROIC INTERVENTION</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>End of your opponent’s Charge phase.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>One unit from your army within 12&quot; of one or more enemy units and not within Engagement Range. A VEHICLE can only be targeted if it is also a CHARACTER or WALKER.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>Resolve a Charge and select one mode before the Charge roll. <b>Leap to Defend:</b> charge targets must have made a Charge move this phase and be within the maximum distance. <b>Into the Fray (+1CP):</b> if the modified Charge roll is greater than 6, change it to 6; charge targets can be any enemy units within 6&quot; and within the maximum distance.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-counteroffensive" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;}]}">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>COUNTEROFFENSIVE</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">2CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>Your opponent’s Fight step, just after an enemy unit has resolved its attacks.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>One unit from your army that is eligible to fight.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>Your unit has Fights First and must be the next unit selected to fight.</p>
</article>
</div>
</section></div>
    </section>
